WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.717
Predict and test an event using repeated fair trials. Record all results and compare

00:00:05.717 --> 00:00:06.899
the observed frequencies.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:12.479
Which is more likely: red (4) or blue (6) bottle tops? The answer is blue. Compare

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:14.569
the counts; 4 red versus 6 blue.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:21.110
A bag at a school fair has 6 red and 5 blue bottle tops. Which colour is more likely

00:00:21.110 --> 00:00:23.791
on one random draw? Pause to choose and explain.

00:00:24.617 --> 00:00:30.361
A bag at a school fair has 6 red and 5 blue bottle tops. Which colour is more likely

00:00:30.361 --> 00:00:35.198
on one random draw? The answer is red. Compare the counts; 6 red versus 5 blue.
